  kind="exact-order",
  default=true,
  note="Exact point order from the guide. Source notes: The order is rebuilt from the guide's step-by-step text plus the displayed final ranks. The text only says 'first talent Ferocity', and the display shows 5/5. The text calls Heart of the Wild a 'Row 2' pick, but it is in row 1 (only a labeling slip; no rule is broken). The guide also has a 'Leveling (1-60) Bear' tab that the fetch did not render, so that variant was not captured. The page says the",
  priorities="Ferocity first, then Heart of the Wild 3/5 and Feral Swiftness 2/2 (30% Cat speed, Dodge in all forms). Next come Feral Charge, Sharpened Claws 2/2, Savage Fury 2/2, Predatory Strikes 3/3, Blood Frenzy 2/2 and Leader of the Pack at 21 points. After that: Natural Instinct 2/2, the rest of Heart of the Wild, Rend and Tear 5/5, then Berserk at 31. The remaining points go into Restoration (Furor 5, Naturalist 5), then back to Feral for Shredding Attacks, Shifting Power and Improved Shifting Power. Natural Shapeshifter 3/3 lowers the cost of shifting and of Shifting Power. Gift of the Earthmother is the last point.",
